 Gusii have significant diaspora populations in the United States (notably Minnesota), United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, New Zealand, and South Africa.",', 'community': 'kisii', 'section': 'section_0', 'relevance': 1.310557246208191, 'source': 'Kisii.txt'}, {'content': '"tags_for_retrieval": [\n    "Gusii",\n    "Abagusii",\n    "Kisii",\n    "Ekegusii",\n    "Kossova",\n    "Kossowa",\n    "Obokano",\n    "Chigware",\n    "Tabaka",\n    "Soapstone",\n    "Kisii County",\n    "Nyamira County",\n    "Great Lakes Bantu",\n    "Northeast Bantu",\n    "Misri",\n    "Gideon Were",\n    "William Ochieng",\n    "Otenyo Nyamaterere",\n    "Gusii migration",\n    "Mount Elgon",\n    "Luo-Gusii relations",\n    "Kipsigis-Gusii relations",\n    "Maasai-Gusii relations",\n    "Bantu-Nilotic interaction",\n    "Cushitic influence",\n    "Ebisarate",\n    "Omochie",\n    "Gusii circumcision",\n    "Chinsoni",\n    "Ogusii",\n    "Obokima",\n    "Chintuga",\n    "Ritoke",\n    "Engoro",\n    "Nyasae",\n    "Omoragori",\n    "Ebirecha",\n    "Gusii colonialism",\n    "Nubi in Kisii",\n    "Maragoli",\n    "Baganda",\n    "Gusii diaspora",\n    "Minnesota Gusii",\n    "Bantu expansion",\n    "Sirikwa",\n    "Loikop",\n    "Savanna Pastoral Neolithic",\n    "South Cushitic",\n    "Kenya highlands",\n    "Kericho",\n    "Bomet",\n    "Gusii architecture",\n    "Gusii warfare",\n    "Chinkororo"\n  ],', 'community': 'kisii', 'section': 'section_13', 'relevance': 1.348983645439148, 'source': 'Kisii.txt'}, {'content': '"tags_for_retrieval": [\n    "Gusii",\n    "Abagusii",\n    "Kisii",\n    "Ekegusii",\n    "Kossova",\n    "Kossowa",\n    "Obokano",\n    "Chigware",\n    "Tabaka",\n    "Soapstone",\n    "Kisii County",\n    "Nyamira County",\n    "Great Lakes Bantu",\n    "Northeast Bantu",\n    "Misri",\n    "Gideon Were",\n    "William Ochieng",\n    "Otenyo Nyamaterere",\n    "Gusii migration",\n    "Mount Elgon",\n    "Luo-Gusii relations",\n    "Kipsigis-Gusii relations",\n    "Ma