e Luo are originators of benga and ohangla music. Unlike neighboring Nilotes (Kalenjin, Maasai), Luo do not practice male circumcision and historically removed six lower incisors as a distinctive ethnic marker.",', 'community': 'luo', 'section': 'section_0', 'relevance': 1.984868049621582, 'source': 'Luo.txt'}]}
