---

### 1. Page Header
- **Title**: “Kenya Cultural Heritage – Explore Top 10 Communities”  
  Sets the overall theme and lets you know you’re in the cultural‑heritage section of the site.  
- **Sub‑header**: “Embu” (or “Gusii”)  
  Clearly labels the community you’re currently viewing.

---

### 2. Navigation Bar
- **Links to other communities** (Kikuyu, Maasai, Luo, etc.)  
